notes:        Edit workspace showing the built-in Resolutor Demo Project (procedurally generated footage and audio), Program monitor with graded Ocean_Sunset.mp4, clip metadata, subtitles panel, project bins, multi-track timeline, and loudness meters. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork.
